\":507370,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/507370.png\",\"name\":\"_Michael0727_\",\"slogan\":\"AFOer || Florrer || Zorrer || ISTJ-A\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Blue\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/image_hosting\\/5qrhiew7.png\"},\"upvote\":6,\"replyCount\":0,\"favorCount\":0,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1307\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 2011 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u6570\\u5b57\\u53cd\\u8f6c\",\"difficulty\":1,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":3,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"# \\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1a\\n\\n[\\u6587\\u7ae0\\u98df\\u7528\\u6548\\u679c\\u66f4\\u4f73](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.com.cn\\/article\\/88t0yv7r)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \\u5ba1\\u9898\\n\\n[\\u9898\\u76ee\\u4f20\\u9001\\u95e8](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.com.cn\\/problem\\/P1307)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \\u601d\\u8def\\n\\n\\u5bf9\\u4e8e\\u8d1f\\u6570\\uff0c\\u5148\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u8d1f\\u53f7\\u3002\\n\\n\\u7136\\u540e\\u4ece\\u540e\\u5f80\\u524d\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u6570\\u5b57\\u5373\\u53ef\\uff0c\\u6ce8\\u610f\\u7279\\u5224**\\u672b\\u5c3e\\u96f6**\\u3002\\n\\n\\u4f5c\\u8005\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u4e2d\\u4f7f\\u7528 int \\u6574\\u5f62\\u4fdd\\u5b58\\u7b54\\u6848\\u540e\\u8f93\\u51fa\\uff0c\\u907f\\u514d\\u5f00\\u5934\\u7684 $0$\\u3002\\n\\n---\\n\\n**AC \\u4ee3\\u7801**\\n\\n```cpp\\n#include \\u003Ciostream\\u003E\\n\\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27#include \\u003Calgorithm\\u003E\\nusing\\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27 namespace std;\\nint main\\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27()\\n{\\n    int n ;\\n    cin \\u003E\\u003E n ;\\n    i\\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27nt m = 0 ;\\n    if ( n \\u003C 0 )\\n    {\\n    \\t\\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27cout \\u003C\\u003C \\u0022-\\u0022 ;\\n    \\tn *= -1 ;\\n    }\\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27\\n    while ( n != 0 )\\n \\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27   {\\n    \\tm = n % 10 + m \\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27* 10 ;\\n    \\tn \\/= 10 ;\\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27\\n    }\\n    cout \\u003C\\u003C m \\u003C\\u003C endl ;\\n    return 0;\\n\\udb40\\udd32\\udb40\\udd69\\udb40\\udd10\\udb40\\udd3d\\udb40\\udd59\\udb40\\udd53\\udb40\\udd58\\udb40\\udd51\\udb40\\udd55\\udb40\\udd5c\\udb40\\udd20\\udb40\\udd27\\udb40\\udd22\\udb40\\udd27}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n[AC \\u8bb0\\u5f55](https:\\/\\/www.luogu.com.cn\\/record\\/49537009)\\n\\n---\\n\\n\\u539f\\u6765\\u5df2\\u7ecf\\u901a\\u8fc7\\uff0c\\u73b0\\u589e\\u52a0\\u9632\\u6284\\u88ad\\u5185\\u5bb9\\uff0c\\u6c42\\u901a\\u8fc7\\u3002\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795629563.918164}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/88t0yv7r\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1aP1307 [NOIP2011 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u6570\\u5b57\\u53cd\\u8f6c\",\"description\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\\uff1a\\n\\u6587\\u7ae0\\u98df\\u7528\\u6548\\u679c\\u66f4\\u4f73\\n\\n\\u5ba1\\u9898\\n\\u9898\\u76ee\\u4f20\\u9001\\u95e8\\n\\n\\u601d\\u8def\\n\\u5bf9\\u4e8e\\u8d1f\\u6570\\uff0c\\u5148\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u8d1f\\u53f7\\u3002\\n\\u7136\\u540e\\u4ece\\u540e\\u5f80\\u524d\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u6570\\u5b57\\u5373\\u53ef\\uff0c\\u6ce8\\u610f\\u7279\\u5224\\u672b\\u5c3e\\u96f6\\u3002\\n\\u4f5c\\u8005\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u4e2d\\u4f7f\\u7528 int \\u6574\\u5f62\\u4fdd\\u5b58\\u7b54\\u6848\\u540e\\u8f93\\u51fa\\uff0c\\u907f\\u514d\\u5f00\\u5934\\u7684 0\\u3002\\n\\nAC \\u4ee3\\u7801\\n#include &lt;iostream&gt;\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"_Michael0727_\"},\"datePublished\":\"2025-01-07T13:00:51+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解：P1307 [NOIP2011 普及组] 数字反转\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"题解：\n文章食用效果更佳\n\n审题\n题目传送门\n\n思路\n对于负数，先输出负号。\n然后从后往前输出数字即可，注意特判末尾零。\n作者代码中使用 int 整形保存答案后输出，避免开头的 0。\n\nAC 代码\n#include &amp;lt;iostream&amp;gt;…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"_Michael0727_\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-01-07T13:00:51+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/88t0yv7r\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解：P1307 [NOIP2011 普及组] 数字反转</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">_Michael0727_</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2025-01-07T13:00:51+08:00\">2025-01-07 13:00:51</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <h1>题解：</h1>\n<p>文章食用效果更佳</p>\n\n<h2>审题</h2>\n<p>题目传送门</p>\n\n<h2>思路</h2>\n<p>对于负数，先输出负号。</p>\n<p>然后从后往前输出数字即可，注意特判<strong>末尾零</strong>。</p>\n<p>作者代码中使用 int 整形保存答案后输出，避免开头的 <la-tex display=\"inline\">0</la-tex>。</p>\n\n<p><strong>AC 代码</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;\n󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧#include &lt;algorithm&gt;\nusing󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧 namespace std;\nint main󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧()\n{\n    int n ;\n    cin &gt;&gt; n ;\n    i󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧nt m = 0 ;\n    if ( n &lt; 0 )\n    {\n        󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧cout &lt;&lt; \"-\" ;\n        n *= -1 ;\n    }󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧\n    while ( n != 0 )\n 󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧   {\n        m = n % 10 + m 󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧* 10 ;\n        n /= 10 ;󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧\n    }\n    cout &lt;&lt; m &lt;&lt; endl ;\n    return 0;\n󠄲󠅩󠄐󠄽󠅙󠅓󠅘󠅑󠅕󠅜󠄠󠄧󠄢󠄧}</code></pre>\n\n<p>AC 记录</p>\n\n<p>原来已经通过，现增加防抄袭内容，求通过。</p>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a6028c032ad32db6',t:'MTc5NTYyOTU2Mw=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a6028c032ad32db6',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
